-- Role combination rules for ONE person holding TWO roles at the same service.
-- GREEN rows are evidence: the church already does these, and the reason says how
-- often. AMBER and RED are the two rules the operator stated explicitly. Note that
-- service leader + worship leader is BOTH observed 6 times AND amber - doing a
-- thing is not the same as it being ideal. Every other combination is deliberately
-- left unset for the vicar to rule on in Settings, rather than invented here.
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO role_combinations (role_a_id,role_b_id,verdict,reason)
